  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender equality support to partner organisations</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d i j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhet till partnerorganisationer</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d i j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhet/kvinnors ekonomiska egenmakt genom work shops och coachning under 6 m&#xE5;nader av 14 samarbetsorganisationer verksamma inom marknadsutveckling (fr&#xE4;mst jordbruk och energi)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support in gender equality/women&apos;s economic empowerment through work shops and coaching during 6 months to 14 partners in the market development sector (primarily agriculture and energy)</narrative>
  </description>
